    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Five to six days after the fight with Gu Yue first head, Tie Xue Leng is at death’s door and sends Mountain Giant Puppet Gu with Iron Fist Grappling Gu for his daughter’s safety. The puppet Gu forms a copper mask over Tie Ruo Nan’s face while the iron hand carries her clear of Qing Mao Mountain. Both Gu were already infected by Blood Frenzy Gu and turn into a pool of blood soon after finishing that task.",
